<title>CHINA: Asia Commercial year net back to blacks.</title>
<headline>Asia Commercial year net back to blacks.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. dollar)	  4.49 gain vs 32.38 loss (see note)</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. dollar)   nil	 vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  367 gain  vs 651 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    253 gain  vs 958 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     697	 vs 1,826.13</p>
<p>    Company name		 Asia Commercial Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Asia Commercial is a maker of watch parts and disk drives. Exceptional gain was mainly led by profit from capital reorganisation, bank comprise and note arrangements.</p>
<p>Earnings per share adjusted for a capital consolidation during the year under review.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6368</p>
